129.7, 129.51, 129.45, 129.12, 129.07, 128.9, 128.5, 127.4, 124.0, 123.5,
121.9, 121.6, 78.6, 24.3, 21.4 ppm; IR (film): 3060, 2929, 1597, 1467,
1298, 1205, 1167, 1128, 1060 cm-1; HRMS (EI) m/z calcd for C29H23NO2S:
449.1450; found: 449.1451.
